  "details": "This issue has been around for a bit now but here's the breakdown:\n\nWhen trying to use the camera on desktop to take a photo of another user's avatar while having your avatar looking in the direction of them, you are unable to take a photo because their \"player bubble\" is in the way, which doesn't let you take a picture.\n\nSee video attached for more info on issue: https://drive.google.com/file/d/17_QggUWxq_lFh7SjxVl0yZBM_cgrU_Fv/view?usp=sharing",
